---
 doc/env_vars.md | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/doc/env_vars.md b/doc/env_vars.md
index 0270fff3..9a05f9cc 100644
--- a/doc/env_vars.md
+++ b/doc/env_vars.md
@@ -118,6 +118,13 @@ Gated-delta-net (Qwen3-Next/3.5, KDA in GLM-5.3/Kimi Linear) counterpart of `EXL
 the decode step of a linear-attention layer runs as one graph-captured C++ call. Set to `0` to
 force the torch path, for A/B testing.
 
+### `EXL3_BC_MLP_MAX_ROWS` (default: `32`)
+
+Most rows (bsz x q_len) the graphed dense GatedMLP path (`BC_GatedMLP`) takes; larger inputs run
+the eager path. The limit is 32 (`MLP_MAX_ROWS`, which also sizes the shared static scratch), so a
+batched speculative verify up to 4 x 8 rows stays graphed; `8` restores the previous limit.
+Read at import.
+
 ### `EXL3_GDN_SUB_CHUNK` (default: `2048`)
 
 Prefill of a gated-delta-net / KDA layer runs the fla chunked scan over consecutive sub-ranges
